# Thrumming Hivepool: at the beginning of Bot1's upkeep it creates two 1/1 Sliver tokens at once (CR 701.7a), and Slivers Bot1
# controls have haste and double strike (CR 613.1f): on turn 3 both attack the turn they are made and each deals 1 first-strike and 1
# regular damage, 4 in all. Bot2's Sizzling Changeling is a Sliver too, every creature type (CR 702.73a), but not one "you control":
# it has no haste on turn 2 and no keywords.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Thrumming Hivepool
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Sizzling Changeling
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Thrumming Hivepool.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
